  "title": "Mechanical Licensing in India: Statutory Promise or Practical Illusion?",
  "summary": "While Section 31C of the Copyright Act aims to democratize music through statutory licensing, it remains a \"practical illusion.\" Complex procedural mandates, judicial inconsistencies, and fragmented rights management create significant barriers. Consequently, a framework intended to facilitate creative reuse often functions as a restrictive, theoretical regime rather than a functional reality.",
